interface.signature:
Auth: JWT required.
Body: { scope: {kind, id?}, model, costCapUsd? }
Response 201: { sessionId, status: 'ACTIVE', model, costCapUsd, expiration: ISO-8601 }
Errors: 400 ValidationError

Auth: JWT required.
Response 200: { sessionId, status, model, costCapUsd, costUsdAccumulated, tokensInAccumulated, tokensOutAccumulated, turnCount, lastActivityAt, claudeSessionId?, errorReason? }
Errors: 403, 404

setCostCapUsd(sessionId: string, capUsd: number): Promise<void>
Atomic UpdateCommand: UpdateExpression: 'SET costCapUsd = :cap' ConditionExpression: 'attribute_exists(sessionId)' ExpressionAttributeValues: { ':cap': capUsd }
Validates capUsd > 0 (no-op if invalid).

function useFreeAgentSession(): {
  messages: FreeAgentMessage[];
  isSending: boolean;
  status: FreeAgentSessionStatus | 'IDLE_NO_SESSION';
  costUsdAccumulated: number;
  costCapUsd: number;
  tokensInAccumulated: number;
  tokensOutAccumulated: number;
  sendMessage(content: string): void;
  setCostCapUsd(capUsd: number): void;
  resetSession(): void;  // for model change forks
}

Internal: TanStack Query mutations for POST /sessions, POST /messages.
Polling query GET /sessions/:id/events with refetchInterval=1500 while status='PROCESSING'.
Aggregates streamed tokens into the active assistant message bubble.
